{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-platform","title":"可观测性平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/observability-platform","wordCount":742,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性平台\">可观测性平台</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可观测性平台是平台工程中保障服务可靠性的关键基础设施。它统一收集、存储和分析系统的三大信号——日志（Logs）、指标（Metrics）和追踪（Traces），让开发者能快速定位和解决生产问题。平台工程的目标是让可观测性成为&quot;默认内置&quot;而非&quot;额外集成&quot;。</p>\n<p>传统模式下，每个团队自行选择和集成监控工具，导致工具碎片化、数据孤岛和故障排查困难。平台化的可观测性将工具选型和集成封装在平台层，开发者只需关注业务指标和告警规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 数据采集&#10;        A[应用日志]&#10;        B[基础设施指标]&#10;        C[分布式追踪]&#10;        D[业务事件]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph OpenTelemetry Collector&#10;        E[接收器]&#10;        F[处理器]&#10;        G[导出器]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 存储与分析&#10;        H[Loki / ES]&#10;        I[Prometheus / Mimir]&#10;        J[Tempo / Jaeger]&#10;        K[Grafana]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph TB\n    subgraph 数据采集\n        A[应用日志]\n        B[基础设施指标]\n        C[分布式追踪]\n        D[业务事件]\n    end\n    subgraph OpenTelemetry Collector\n        E[接收器]\n        F[处理器]\n        G[导出器]\n    end\n    subgraph 存储与分析\n        H[Loki / ES]\n        I[Prometheus / Mimir]\n        J[Tempo / Jaeger]\n        K[Grafana]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>工具选型</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>事件记录、错误排查</td>\n<td>Loki / Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>Fluentd / OTel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标</td>\n<td>趋势监控、告警</td>\n<td>Prometheus / Mimir</td>\n<td>Pull / Push</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪</td>\n<td>请求链路分析</td>\n<td>Tempo / Jaeger</td>\n<td>SDK 自动注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件</td>\n<td>变更记录、审计</td>\n<td>自定义存储</td>\n<td>Webhook / API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry-统一采集\">OpenTelemetry 统一采集</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）是 CNCF 的可观测性标准，统一了日志、指标和追踪的采集协议和 SDK。平台工程推荐以 OTel 作为可观测性的统一采集层，避免工具锁定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# OpenTelemetry Collector 配置&#10;apiVersion: opentelemetry.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: OpenTelemetryCollector&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: platform-collector&#10;spec:&#10;  mode: daemonset&#10;  config: |&#10;    receivers:&#10;      otlp:&#10;        protocols:&#10;          grpc:&#10;            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317&#10;          http:&#10;            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318&#10;      prometheus:&#10;        config:&#10;          scrape_configs:&#10;            - job_name: kubernetes-pods&#10;              kubernetes_sd_configs:&#10;                - role: pod&#10;&#10;    processors:&#10;      batch:&#10;        send_batch_size: 1000&#10;        timeout: 10s&#10;      memory_limiter:&#10;        check_interval: 1s&#10;        limit_mib: 512&#10;      resource:&#10;        attributes:&#10;          - key: cluster&#10;            value: production-us-east&#10;            action: upsert&#10;&#10;    exporters:&#10;      otlp/tempo:&#10;        endpoint: tempo.observability:4317&#10;      prometheusremotewrite:&#10;        endpoint: http://mimir.observability:9009/api/v1/push&#10;      loki:&#10;        endpoint: http://loki.observability:3100/loki/api/v1/push&#10;&#10;    service:&#10;      pipelines:&#10;        traces:&#10;          receivers: [otlp]&#10;          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]&#10;          exporters: [otlp/tempo]&#10;        metrics:&#10;          receivers: [otlp, prometheus]&#10;          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]&#10;          exporters: [prometheusremotewrite]&#10;        logs:&#10;          receivers: [otlp]&#10;          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]&#10;          exporters: [loki]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OpenTelemetry Collector 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opentelemetry.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OpenTelemetryCollector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">platform-collector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">daemonset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    receivers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      otlp:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        protocols:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          grpc:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          http:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      prometheus:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        config:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          scrape_configs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            - job_name: kubernetes-pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              kubernetes_sd_configs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                - role: pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    processors:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      batch:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        send_batch_size: 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        timeout: 10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      memory_limiter:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        check_interval: 1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        limit_mib: 512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      resource:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        attributes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          - key: cluster</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            value: production-us-east</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            action: upsert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    exporters:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      otlp/tempo:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        endpoint: tempo.observability:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      prometheusremotewrite:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        endpoint: http://mimir.observability:9009/api/v1/push</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      loki:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        endpoint: http://loki.observability:3100/loki/api/v1/push</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    service:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      pipelines:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        traces:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          receivers: [otlp]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          exporters: [otlp/tempo]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        metrics:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          receivers: [otlp, prometheus]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          exporters: [prometheusremotewrite]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        logs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          receivers: [otlp]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          processors: [memory_limiter, batch, resource]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          exporters: [loki]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OTelPlatformIntegration {&#10;  autoInstrumentation: {&#10;    description: &#39;无代码修改的自动追踪注入&#39;;&#10;    mechanism: &#39;Kubernetes Operator 自动注入 OTel SDK&#39;;&#10;    languages: [&#39;Java&#39;, &#39;Python&#39;, &#39;Node.js&#39;, &#39;Go&#39;, &#39;.NET&#39;];&#10;    config: &#39;通过 Pod 注解触发：instrumentation.opentelemetry.io/inject-nodejs: true&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  standardAttributes: {&#10;    required: [&#39;service.name&#39;, &#39;service.version&#39;, &#39;deployment.environment&#39;, &#39;k8s.namespace.name&#39;, &#39;k8s.pod.name&#39;];&#10;    recommended: [&#39;team.name&#39;, &#39;service.tier&#39;, &#39;cost.center&#39;];&#10;    enforcement: &#39;OTel Collector 的 resource processor 自动补充&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  samplingStrategy: {&#10;    traces: {&#10;      headSampling: &#39;10% 基准采样&#39;;&#10;      tailSampling: &#39;错误请求和慢请求 100% 保留&#39;;&#10;      rule: &#39;P99 延迟 &gt; SLO 阈值 → 100% 采样&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTelPlatformIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  autoInstrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '无代码修改的自动追踪注入'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Kubernetes Operator 自动注入 OTel SDK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    languages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Java'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Python'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9