/span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              service_name=\"order-service\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            }[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            > 0.01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            team</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service 错误率超过 1%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            runbook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://wiki.example.com/runbooks/high-error-rate'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>告警设计的核心原则是&quot;可操作的告警&quot;：每条告警都应该有明确的 Runbook（操作手册），告诉值班人员如何排查和修复。无 Runbook 的告警应该被视为平台缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关联分析与故障排查\">关联分析与故障排查</h2><p>三大信号的真正价值在于关联分析：通过 TraceID 将日志、指标和追踪串联起来，实现从告警到根因的快速定位。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[告警触发] --&gt; B[Grafana 仪表板]&#10;    B --&gt; C[异常指标定位]&#10;    C --&gt; D[关联追踪查询]&#10;    D --&gt; E[追踪详情]&#10;    E --&gt; F[关联日志]&#10;    F --&gt; G[根因定位]&#10;    G --&gt; H[修复/回滚]\">graph LR\n    A[告警触发] --&gt; B[Grafana 仪表板]\n    B --&gt; C[异常指标定位]\n    C --&gt; D[关联追踪查询]\n    D --&gt; E[追踪详情]\n    E --&gt; F[关联日志]\n    F --&gt; G[根因定位]\n    G --&gt; H[修复/回滚]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CorrelationStrategy {&#10;  traceContext: {&#10;    propagation: &#39;W3C Trace Context 标准&#39;;&#10;    format: &#39;traceparent: 00-{traceId}-{spanId}-{flags}&#39;;&#10;    injection: &#39;OTel SDK 自动传播到下游服务&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  logCorrelation: {&#10;    mechanism: &#39;日志中自动注入 trace_id 和 span_id&#39;;&#10;    query: &#39;在 Grafana 中从追踪跳转到关联日志&#39;;&#10;    benefit: &#39;精确定位特定请求的日志上下文&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  metricCorrelation: {&#10;    exemplars: &#39;指标数据点关联到具体的 TraceID&#39;;&#10;    query: &#39;从异常指标点击跳转到具体追踪&#39;;&#10;    benefit: &#39;从宏观指标异常深入到微观请求细节&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  workflow: [&#10;    &#39;1. 告警触发 → Grafana 仪表板&#39;,&#10;    &#39;2. 识别异常时间窗口和服务&#39;,&#10;    &#39;3. 从异常指标点击 Exemplar → 追踪详情&#39;,&#10;    &#39;4. 在追踪中找到异常 Span&#39;,&#10;    &#39;5. 从 Span 跳转到关联日志&#39;,&#10;    &#39;6. 日志中定位具体错误信息&#39;,&#10;    &#39;7. 修复或回滚&#39;,&#10;  ];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CorrelationStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  traceContext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    propagation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'W3C Trace Context 标准'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'traceparent: 00-{traceId}-{spanId}-{flags}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    injection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OTel SDK 自动传播到下游服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  logCorrelation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '日志中自动注入 trace_id 和 span_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '在 Grafana 中从追踪跳转到关联日志'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    benefit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '精确定位特定请求的日志上下文'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metricCorrelation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    exemplars</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '指标数据点关联到具体的 TraceID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '从异常指标点击跳转到具体追踪'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    benefit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '从宏观指标异常深入到微观请求细节'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  workflow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '1. 告警触发 → Grafana 仪表板'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '2. 识别异常时间窗口和服务'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '3. 从异常指标点击 Exemplar → 追踪详情'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '4. 在追踪中找到异常 Span'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '5. 从 Span 跳转到关联日志'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '6. 日志中定位具体错误信息'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '7. 修复或回滚'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关联分析的前提是统一的元数据标准。所有信号必须包含一致的标签（service.name, deployment.environment, k8s.namespace.name），才能在 Grafana 中实现无缝跳转。平台团队通过 OTel Collector 的 resource processor 强制补充这些标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((可观测性平台))&#10;    三大信号&#10;      日志 Logs&#10;      指标 Metrics&#10;      追踪 Traces&#10;    OpenTelemetry&#10;      统一协议&#10;      自动注入&#10;      Collector 管道&#10;    仪表板与告警&#10;      标准化模板&#10;      告警路由&#10;      Runbook 关联&#10;    关联分析&#10;      TraceID 串联&#10;      Exemplar 跳转&#10;      快速定位根因\">mindmap\n  root((可观测性平台))\n    三大信号\n      日志 Logs\n      指标 Metrics\n      追踪 Traces\n    OpenTelemetry\n      统一协议\n      自动注入\n      Collector 管道\n    仪表板与告警\n      标准化模板\n      告警路由\n      Runbook 关联\n    关联分析\n      TraceID 串联\n      Exemplar 跳转\n      快速定位根因</pre><ul>\n<li>可观测性平台统一日志、指标和追踪的采集、存储和分析</li>\n<li>OpenTelemetry 是推荐的统一采集标准，避免工具锁定</li>\n<li>OTel 自动注入让开发者无需改代码即可获得追踪能力</li>\n<li>标准化仪表板模板 + 可操作的告警是平台可观测性的核心交付</li>\n<li>TraceID 关联分析实现从告警到根因的快速定位路径</li>\n<li>每条告警必须有 Runbook——无 Runbook 的告警是平台缺陷</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性平台","id":"可观测性平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry 统一采集","id":"opentelemetry-统一采集"},{"level":2,"text":"统一仪表板与告警","id":"统一仪表板与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"关联分析与故障排查","id":"关联分析与故障排查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器编排平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/container-orchestration-platform"},"next":{"title":"密钥与配置管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/secrets-and-config-management"}}